 {
  "heading": "### 3.7 Device \u2014 join a partner meeting",
  "intro": "The conference must be started first (`POST /v1/meetings/conferences/{id}/start`); joins are admitted only while it is LIVE (`409 CONFERENCE_NOT_LIVE` otherwise). The user token must carry an `mtg` grant for the conference. Partner meeting chat is NOT read through `/api/v2/conferences/{id}/messages`: the joined user finds the MANAGED meeting conversation (`context.namespace = \"meeting\"`, `context.reference = \"conference:<id>\"`) with their partner session device (3.3).",
  "ops": [
   [
    "A",
    "POST",
    "/api/v2/conferences/{id}/join"
   ]
  ]
 },
